{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And they shall make Me a sanctuary.</b> He called the Tabernacle a sanctuary (מקדש) because it is consecrated by the indwelling of the Shekhinah. And it is possible to say that it is because it is a counterpart of the heavenly Temple. And in the Midrash: ״ועשו לי״ — the Holy One, blessed be He, said to Israel: You are My flock and I am the shepherd. You are My flock, as it is said (Ezekiel 34:17): ״ואתנה צאני״; and I am the shepherd, as it is written (Psalms 80:2): ״רועה ישראל האזינה״ — make a fold for the shepherd that he may come and tend you. You are a vineyard, as it is said (Isaiah 5:7): ״כי כרם ה׳ צבאות בית ישראל״, and I am the watchman, as it is said (Psalms 121:4): ״הנה לא ינום ולא יישן שומר ישראל״ — make a booth for the watchman that he may come and watch over you. You are sons and I am your father. You are sons, as it is said (Deuteronomy 14:1): ״בנים אתם לה׳ אלהיכם״, and I am your father, as it is said (Jeremiah 31:9): ״כי הייתי לישראל לאב״. There is honor for sons when they are with their father, and honor for the father when he is with his sons, and so it says (Proverbs 17:6): ״עטרת זקנים בני בנים ותפארת בנים אבותם״ — make a house for the father that he may come and dwell among you. Hence the verse: ״ועשו לי מקדש ושכנתי בתוכם״, in the manner of what is written (Exodus 29:45): ״ושכנתי בתוך בני ישראל״; the Num. 24:5 event [read: He calls it] ושכינתי — 'and I shall make My Shekhinah dwell.'" "<b>And there is</b> in the word ושכנתי a hint to the number of years that the First Temple and the Second Temple stood. The First Temple stood 410 years, equal to the numerical value of לשכנ״י בתוכם, and this is ושכנתי — ושכן 410. And the Second Temple stood 420 years, and this is ושכנתי — ושני 420. And this is clear."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The final words 'קרי ביה ושכינתי' are textually difficult; the Hebrew appears possibly corrupt or elliptical. Translated hyper-literally; exact sense uncertain.", 1 "The gematria is reproduced exactly as written: לשכנ״י בתוכם = 410, ושכן = 410, ושני = 420, following the author's stated values without verification."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:04:02.523877816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}